Z||000003||My7Fieros||10-29-2001||11:15 PM||||EEK! Right click on internet explorer and go to properties...then click on "use default" to get rid of the warez and back to your original i.e. default. <BR>There are lots of sites like that that do the same thing and weave themselves into everything in your computer making it very difficult to delete/uninstall. That Bonzi Buddy (the purple monkey thing) is just as bad, if not worse. I could NEVER get completley rid of it...I eventually had to run the recovery disk in my 'puter (not for that reason, though) and that got rid of it (obviously).||||reg||1
